        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pablo Trapero, Aleksander Ford\n- Roles: film producer, editor, director, head of the Polish People's Army Film Crew\n- Places: Argentina, Kiev, Russian Empire, Soviet Union, Naples, Florida, United States\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Aleksander Ford was born as Mosze Lifszyc on 24 November 1908 in Kiev in the Russian Empire.\n- Pablo Trapero was born on 4 October 1971.\n- Aleksander Ford was a Polish Jewish film director.\n- During World War II, Aleksander Ford was the head of the Polish People's Army Film Crew in the Soviet Union.\n- Pablo Trapero is an Argentine film producer, editor, and director.\n- Aleksander Ford died on 4 April 1980 in Naples, Florida, United States.",
